# astrion-skill v1
goal: Raise system volume one step
trigger:
  - phrase: "louder"
  - phrase: "volume up"
  - phrase: "turn up the volume"
do: |
  Raise the system output volume by 10% via the system.setVolume
  capability. Cap at 100%. Briefly show the new level in a notification
  toast with a volume icon.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 100
  reversibility: FREE
